# Feature Component Patterns

## Export Style

Use named exports for feature components:

```tsx
export const InvestmentBuyPage = ({ poolId }: { poolId: number }) => {
  // ...
};
```

## Co-located File Structure

Each feature directory uses these co-located files:

- `index.tsx` -- main component
- `fetcher.ts` -- data fetching hooks (useFetcher)
- `schema.ts` -- zod form validation schema
- `interface.ts` -- TypeScript types/interfaces
- `variables.ts` -- constants

## Import Order

External deps first, then `@/` alias imports, then relative -- all alphabetized, no blank lines between groups:

```tsx
import cx from "clsx";
import { useRouter } from "expo-router";
import { useGetPoolDetail } from "../fetcher";
import { type InvestmentCategoryType } from "../interface";
import { Button, Text, View } from "@/uikit/core";
import { formatNumber } from "@/utils/format";
```

## Styling

- Tailwind via `className` prop, conditional classes via `cx` from `clsx`
- Use UI primitives from `@/uikit/core` (Button, Text, View, Icon, Input, etc.)
- Vietnamese text for user-facing strings (or i18n keys via `useTranslation`)
